# Never commit real/private data — only *.stub.yaml files are public.
# (See CLAUDE.md "Build in public": agent public, career data private.)
# One scheme (QUESTIONS.md Q9): *.stub.yaml committed, *.real.yaml private.
data/*.real.yaml
data/*.private.yaml
data/jd-gaps.yaml
# Legacy pattern, kept so old personal files can never leak.
data/my-*.yaml
# Private usage-evidence trail (rank runs, shipped outputs, recall sessions).
data/evidence.jsonl

# macOS/iCloud duplicate files ("name 2.ext") — Documents is iCloud-synced and
# Finder-style duplicates have twice snuck into commits. Never track them.
* 2.*
*\ 2/
